This library is a new implementation, in TypeScript, of the motion models of
pooltool (https://github.com/ekiefl/pooltool) by Evan Kiefl, which is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Parts of it follow pooltool's
implementation of those models closely, and its default cloth, cushion and ball
numbers are pooltool's.
